<title>NETHERLANDS: Ceteco H1 net profit rises 10.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Ceteco H1 net profit rises 10.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.79 vs   0.73</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.8  vs   5.2</p>
<p>    Turnover			     287.4  vs 201.7</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    30.7  vs  20.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    23.4  vs  13.9</p>
<p>    Tax					0.6  vs   1.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Trading company and retailer Ceteco Holding NV, which is 70 pct owned by Hagemeyer, previously said it expected further profit growth in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
